    <string name="set_about_title">About TikTV</string>
    <string name="set_about_sub">Unofficial TV wrapper — version %1$s</string>
    <string name="set_about_body">TikTV is an unofficial client that shows TikTok\'s public website full screen and adds remote-control navigation. It is not affiliated with TikTok and uses no private API.\n\nSigning in with Google is blocked by Google inside embedded browsers, so use phone number, email or username sign-in instead.\n\nTikTok changes its website regularly. If feed navigation stops working, open the app menu → Diagnostics.</string>
